OL,7,G0900 Dorset: Country and Coast
OL,8,     FWe visit the Isle of Purbeck;
OL,9,     FSherborne's oldest working bakery;
OL,10,     Fand 18-mile-long Chesil Beach with
OL,11,     Fits oyster farm. And at Sherborne
OL,12,     FAbbey, bell ringers practice for
OL,13,     Fthe Coronation. (Ep2)
OL,14,G1000 Dorset: Country and Coast
OL,15,     FThis episode features Weymouth
OL,16,     Fwith its beautiful golden beaches
OL,17,     Fand historic harbour, where we
OL,18,     Fvisit the town's oldest ice cream
OL,19,     Fparlour, Bennetts Water Gardens
OL,20,     Fand Abbotsbury Swannery. (Ep3)
