OL,5,G1900 Elizabeth: 10 Years That Changed
OL,6,G     the Royals
OL,7,     FHow, from the 70s onwards, Queen
OL,8,     FElizabeth II adopted a new and
OL,9,     Fextraordinarily successful
OL,10,     Fapproach to her public
OL,11,     Fappearances, said to have forged
OL,12,     Fthe modern monarchy.
OL,13,G2030 The Jubilee of '77: Pomp Pageantry
OL,14,G     & Parties
OL,15,     FThis documentary looks back at
OL,16,     FElizabeth II's memorable Silver
OL,17,     FJubilee, when large-scale parties
OL,18,     Fand parades were held across the
OL,19,     FCommonwealth.
